    "rules": "==================================================\n\nSUPPORTED FORMAT:\n- 1v1 only\n\nNOTE:\nDoubles Copycat and asymmetric Copycats are separate Challenge concepts and will be documented separately.\n\n\nOBJECTIVE\n\nContinue copying and upgrading freestyle shots until somebody fails a required copy.\n\n\nRULES\n\nBrowser randomly chooses starting Setter.\n\nSETTER PHASE\n\nSetter:\n- Calls freestyle shot.\n- Gets 1 attempt.\n\nSetter misses:\n- No loss.\n- Chain ends.\n- Roles switch.\n- New Setter begins a new chain.\n\nSetter makes:\n- Opponent becomes Copier.\n\n\nCOPY PHASE\n\nCopier gets:\n1 attempt to replicate required shot.\n\nCopier fails:\n- Copier immediately loses entire Challenge.\n\nCopier succeeds:\n- Copier survives.\n- Copier now receives 1 optional/required Upgrade Attempt as defined below.\n\n\nUPGRADE PHASE\n\nThe successful Copier gets:\n1 attempt to make the shot harder / upgrade it.\n\nIf Upgrade MISSES:\n- Player does NOT lose.\n- Chain ends safely.\n- Reset roles for new chain.\n\nIf Upgrade SUCCEEDS:\n- That upgraded version becomes new required shot.\n- Opponent must copy it once.\n\nThis may repeat:\nCopy → Upgrade → Copy → Upgrade\nuntil:\n- A required copy fails = immediate loss.\n- An upgrade fails = chain safely resets.\n\n\nBROWSER UI\n\nBecause this has multiple sub-states, browser should manage the flow.\n\nShow:\nCurrent role:\n- Setter\n- Copier\n- Upgrader\n\nHost controls:\n\nSetter:\n- Made\n- Missed\n\nIf Made:\nCopier:\n- Copied\n- Failed Copy\n\nFailed Copy:\nImmediate result.\n\nCopied:\nUpgrade:\n- Upgrade Made\n- Upgrade Missed\n\nUpgrade Made:\nSwap copier requirement to opponent.\n\nUpgrade Missed:\nEnd chain and begin fresh Setter phase.\n\nBrowser does not need the textual shot call.\nPlayers communicate the call verbally.\n\nRECOVERY\n\nHost:\nUndo Last Action\n\nIf \"Failed Copy\" was accidentally pressed:\nUndo must restore that player rather than immediately permanently committing rewards.\n\nDo not apply Board Game rewards until Host passes the result confirmation screen.\n\n\n=================================================="
