    "engine": "numeric",
    "tournament": false,
    "tag": false,
    "rules": "==================================================\n\nSUPPORTED FORMATS:\n- 1v1\n- 1v1v1\n- 1v1v1v1\n- 2v2\n- 1v2 / 2v1\n- 1v3 / 3v1\n\n\nCORE RULES\n\nEvery standard player gets:\n3 shot attempts.\n\nOnly successfully scored goals count.\n\nSuccessful goal:\nUse displayed KPH.\n\nMiss / no goal:\n0 KPH.\n\nInitial score:\nSum that player's 3 attempt values.\n\n\nBROWSER INPUT SYSTEM\n\nThis Challenge SHOULD be browser-scored.\n\nEach player has:\n- Numeric KPH entry box.\n- Submit Attempt button.\n- Attempt counter.\n- Running total.\n\nNumeric input:\n- Numbers only.\n- Allow 0.\n- 0 represents miss.\n- Do not accept negative values.\n- Do not artificially reject high KPH values.\n\nEach player may only submit the number of normal attempts allowed by that format.\n\nBefore final result:\nAllow player/Host to correct most recent accidental entry.\n\nRecommended:\n\"Undo Last Attempt\"\n\nDo not let a player edit another player's values.\n\nEveryone can see:\n- Submitted attempts\n- Running totals\n\nOnly calculate initial winner after every required player has completed 3 submissions.\n\nAfter last required submission:\nPause briefly.\nThen reveal result.\n\nDo not jump directly into Board Game rewards.\n\n\n1v1\n\nPlayer A:\n3 attempts.\n\nPlayer B:\n3 attempts.\n\nTotal each player's 3 KPH values.\n\nHigher total:\nWins.\n\nIf tied:\nShow popup:\n\"TIE — 1 ADDITIONAL ATTEMPT\"\n\nEach player gets:\n1 tiebreak attempt.\n\nCompare ONLY that paired tiebreak round.\n\nHigher KPH:\nWins.\n\nIf equal:\nRepeat another one-attempt tiebreak.\n\nMiss:\n0.\n\n\n1v1v1\n\nEach player:\n3 attempts.\n\nRank players by total KPH.\n\nFor tied placements:\nOnly tied players take 1 additional attempt.\n\nUse those tiebreak attempts to separate only that tied group.\n\nIf still tied:\nRepeat.\n\nUntied placements remain locked.\n\n\n1v1v1v1\n\nSame for 4 players.\n\nFull placement 1st–4th.\n\nOnly tied players tiebreak.\n\n\n2v2\n\nEach player:\n3 individual attempts.\n\nTherefore:\nEach team has 6 initial shot values total.\n\nTeam score:\nSum both teammates' individual totals.\n\nHigher team total:\nWins.\n\nTie:\nEvery player receives 1 additional tiebreak attempt.\n\nTeam tiebreak score:\nSum both teammates' new tiebreak shots.\n\nHigher:\nWins.\n\nRepeat one-attempt-per-player team tiebreak rounds until separated.\n\n\n1v2 / 2v1 — 2× SOLO SPEED\n\nSolo:\n3 attempts.\n\nEach Duo member:\n3 attempts.\n\nSolo base total:\nSum Solo's 3 shots.\n\nSolo weighted score:\nSolo total ×2.\n\nDuo score:\nSum all 6 Duo attempts.\n\nCompare weighted Solo score vs Duo combined score.\n\nTie:\nEvery participant takes 1 additional tiebreak attempt.\n\nTiebreak:\nSolo new shot ×2\nvs\nDuo Player 1 new shot + Duo Player 2 new shot.\n\nRepeat until separated.\n\n\n1v3 / 3v1 — 3× SOLO SPEED\n\nSolo:\n3 attempts.\n\nEach Trio member:\n3 attempts.\n\nSolo weighted:\nSolo 3-shot total ×3.\n\nTrio:\nSum all 9 team attempts.\n\nTie:\nEvery participant gets 1 additional attempt.\n\nCompare:\nSolo tiebreak KPH ×3\nvs\nsum of 3 Trio tiebreak KPH values.\n\nRepeat until separated.\n\n\nUI DISPLAY FOR MULTIPLIER VERSIONS\n\nDo not hide the math.\n\nExample 1v2 display:\n\nSOLO\nRaw Total: 282 KPH\n×2\nWeighted Total: 564\n\nDUO\nPlayer B: 286\nPlayer C: 270\nTeam Total: 556\n\nThis reduces arguments and manual calculation mistakes.\n\n\nMISENTRY RECOVERY\n\nBefore final calculation:\nPlayer may Undo Last Attempt.\n\nAfter final calculation but before reward confirmation:\nHost may use Correct Inputs.\n\nCorrect Inputs:\n- Return to score table.\n- Do not rerandomize teams or reset Challenge.\n- Recalculate result once corrected.\n\nOnce Board Game rewards are fully committed:\nUse the broader Battle correction flow rather than silently changing the Challenge state."
