    "rules": "==================================================\n\nSUPPORTED FORMATS:\n- 1v1\n- 1v1v1\n- 1v1v1v1\n- 2v2\n- 1v2 / 2v1\n- 1v3 / 3v1\n\n\nCORE TRAINING RULES\n\nUse same long Custom Training pack.\n\nRecommended size:\n20–30+ shots.\n\nStart:\nShot #1.\n\nProgress:\nIn order.\n\nMiss:\nMay retry.\n\nNo skipping.\n\nScore:\nNumber of successfully completed shots within assigned time.\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n1v1 — TRAINING PACK ENDURANCE\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nTime Limit:\n2 minutes.\n\nBoth players run SIMULTANEOUSLY.\n\nOne shared synchronized 2-minute countdown.\n\nOnly Host gets:\nSTART TIMER\n\nOnce started:\nAll screens show same countdown.\n\nAt 0:\nPlay clear alert sound.\n\nThen enable Host result selection:\n- Player A Won\n- Player B Won\n- Draw\n\nMore completed shots:\nWins.\n\nEqual completed shots:\nDraw.\n\nBrowser does not need players to enter exact completed-shot numbers unless desired.\nHost can select final result based on players' manually known progress.\n\nRecovery:\nHost can Restart Timer before official result if setup failed.\n\nRestart Timer confirmation:\n\"This resets the Endurance run for everyone. Continue?\"\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n1v1v1 — TRAINING PACK ENDURANCE\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nSame:\n2-minute synchronized simultaneous timer.\n\nAll 3 use same pack.\n\nAt expiration:\nRank by number of completed shots.\n\nEqual completed shots:\nShared placement.\n\nBrowser:\nHost enters each player's completed-shot count after timer.\n\nNumeric whole numbers only.\n\nThen browser calculates placements automatically.\n\nAllow:\nCorrect Counts\nbefore rewards.\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n1v1v1v1 — TRAINING PACK ENDURANCE\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nSame with 4 players.\n\n2-minute shared timer.\n\nEnter completed-shot counts.\nRank automatically.\nTies share placement.\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n2v2 — TRAINING PACK ENDURANCE\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nAll 4 players:\nSame pack.\nSame 2-minute synchronized timer.\n\nThis version uses INDIVIDUAL winner for team.\n\nAt expiration:\nCompare all 4 individual completed-shot totals.\n\nHighest individual result:\nWins Challenge for that player's team.\n\nIf highest result is shared by multiple players:\n\nIf all highest-tied players are on same team:\nThat team wins.\n\nIf highest-tied players include members of both teams:\nDraw.\n\nDo not sum teammates' progress for this version.\n\nBrowser:\nHost/player enters completed-shot counts.\nBrowser determines team outcome.\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n1v2 / 2v1 — ASYMMETRIC ENDURANCE\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nSolo gets:\n2-minute individual run.\n\nEach Duo member gets:\n1-minute individual run.\n\nDo NOT use one shared countdown because the run lengths differ.\n\nUse separate player timers.\n\nSuggested run flow:\nBrowser randomizes run order.\n\nFor each player:\n- Start Run\n- Countdown appropriate duration\n- At 0 alert sound\n- Enter completed-shot count\n- Confirm / Redo Run\n\nDuo Score:\nDuo A completed shots + Duo B completed shots.\n\nSolo Score:\nSolo completed shots after 2 minutes.\n\nHigher:\nWins.\n\nEqual:\nDraw.\n\nRedo:\nRedo only that individual's run.\nDo not erase other official runs.\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n1v3 / 3v1 — ASYMMETRIC ENDURANCE\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nSolo:\n3-minute individual run.\n\nEach Trio member:\n1-minute individual run.\n\nTrio Score:\nA + B + C completed shots.\n\nSolo Score:\nSolo completed shots.\n\nHigher:\nWins.\n\nEqual:\nDraw.\n\nBrowser:\nSame independent timer/count system.\n\n\n=================================================="
