    "rules": "==================================================\n\nSUPPORTED FORMATS:\n- 1v1\n- 1v1v1\n- 1v1v1v1\n- 2v2\n- 1v2 / 2v1\n- 1v3 / 3v1\n\n\nCORE RULES\n\nEach standard player gets:\n3 attempts.\n\nEvery attempt must be:\nA legitimate pinch.\n\nA normal power shot:\nDoes NOT count.\n\nOnly successful pinch GOALS record KPH.\n\nMiss:\n0 KPH.\n\nPlayer total:\nSum all 3 attempt values.\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nBROWSER KPH SYSTEM\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nUse same robust KPH-entry pattern as Speed Challenge.\n\nEach player:\n- Numeric field\n- Submit\n- Attempt counter\n- Running total\n\nAllow:\n0 for miss.\n\nAfter submission:\nAllow Undo Last Attempt before final result.\n\nBrowser calculates totals when possible.\n\n\n==================================================\n1v1 — PINCH BATTLE\n==================================================\n\nEach:\n3 attempts.\n\nHigher total KPH:\nWins.\n\nTie:\nEach receives 1 additional pinch attempt.\n\nCompare tiebreak KPH.\n\nIf tied:\nRepeat.\n\n\n==================================================\n1v1v1\n==================================================\n\nEach player:\n3 attempts.\n\nRank by total KPH.\n\nOnly tied players take additional 1-attempt tiebreaks.\n\nRepeat until tied placements separated.\n\n\n==================================================\n1v1v1v1\n==================================================\n\nSame with 4 players.\n\nFull placement.\n\n\n==================================================\n2v2 — INDIVIDUAL PINCH TEAM TOTAL\n==================================================\n\nIMPORTANT:\nThis is NOT the separate Team Pinch Challenge.\n\nEach player performs their OWN pinch attempts.\n\nEach player:\n3 attempts.\n\nTeam total:\nAll 6 individual pinch attempt KPH values combined.\n\nHigher team total:\nWins.\n\nTie:\nEvery player gets 1 extra individual pinch attempt.\n\nSum new teammate KPH.\n\nRepeat until separated.\n\n\n==================================================\n1v2 / 2v1 — 2× SOLO PINCH\n==================================================\n\nSolo:\n3 attempts.\n\nSolo raw total ×2.\n\nDuo:\nEach member 3 attempts.\nAdd all Duo KPH.\n\nHigher weighted side:\nWins.\n\nTie:\nEach participant gets 1 extra pinch attempt.\n\nCompare:\nSolo KPH ×2\nvs\nDuo A + Duo B.\n\nRepeat until separated.\n\n\n==================================================\n1v3 / 3v1 — 3× SOLO PINCH\n==================================================\n\nSolo raw total:\n3 attempts.\n\nWeighted:\n×3.\n\nTrio:\n3 attempts per member.\n9 total values.\n\nHigher:\nWins.\n\nTie:\n1 extra pinch per participant.\n\nCompare Solo ×3 against sum of Trio tiebreak attempts.\n\nRepeat until separated.\n\n\n=================================================="
