    "rules": "==================================================\n\nSUPPORTED FORMATS:\n- 1v1\n- 1v1v1v1 Tournament\n- 2v2\n\n\n==================================================\n1v1 — HEATSEEKER 1v1\n==================================================\n\nUse Rocket League Heatseeker mode.\n\nMatch Length:\n2 minutes.\n\nHighest score:\nWins.\n\nTie:\nContinue.\nNext goal wins.\n\nBrowser:\nNo special game-state logic required.\n\nUse default result screen.\n\n\n==================================================\n1v1v1v1 — HEATSEEKER TOURNAMENT\n==================================================\n\nUse Global Tournament System.\n\nEach mini-match:\n2-minute Heatseeker 1v1.\n\nTie:\nNext goal.\n\nSemifinals:\nSimultaneous.\n\nFinal / 3rd:\nHost chooses simultaneous or sequential.\n\n\n==================================================\n2v2 — HEATSEEKER 2v2\n==================================================\n\nMatch Length:\n3 minutes.\n\nNormal Heatseeker 2v2 rules.\n\nHighest team score:\nWins.\n\nTie:\nNext goal.\n\nBrowser:\nDefault team result screen.\n\n\n=================================================="
