    "rules": "==================================================\n\nSUPPORTED FORMATS:\n- 1v1\n- 1v1v1\n- 1v1v1v1\n- 1v2 / 2v1 Tag-Team\n- 1v3 / 3v1 Tag-Team\n\n\nCORE OBJECTIVE\n\nComplete an ordered:\n\nEASY\n→ MEDIUM\n→ HARD\n\nmechanic sequence as quickly/far as possible within:\n1 minute.\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nDRAFT\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nA Gauntlet draft contains:\n\n1 random Easy mechanic\n1 random Medium mechanic\n1 random Hard mechanic\n\nWithin ONE head-to-head/run group:\nEveryone being compared uses the SAME draft.\n\nMechanics must be completed:\nIN ORDER.\n\nCannot attempt Medium officially until Easy is completed.\n\nCannot attempt Hard officially until Medium is completed.\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nRUNS ARE SEQUENTIAL\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nPlayers do NOT run simultaneously.\n\nBrowser randomly selects run order.\n\nOne player completes their full 1-minute run.\n\nThen next player runs.\n\nThis is important because browser records exact lap/progression times.\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nSTOPWATCH\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nTimer:\nStarts at 0.0.\n\nCounts UP toward:\n1:00.0.\n\nVisible/synchronized to everyone.\n\nAt 1:00.0:\nRun ends automatically.\n\nCompletion input after 1:00.0:\nMust NOT count.\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nACTIVE PLAYER BUTTON FLOW\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nBefore run:\nSTART GAUNTLET\n\nOn start:\nShow:\n\nCOMPLETE EASY\n\nWhen pressed:\nRecord Easy lap timestamp.\nReplace button with:\n\nCOMPLETE MEDIUM\n\nWhen pressed:\nRecord Medium lap timestamp.\nReplace with:\n\nCOMPLETE HARD\n\nWhen pressed:\nRecord Hard completion timestamp.\nRun finishes successfully.\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nFAILED / INCOMPLETE RUN\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nPlayer may retry current mechanic repeatedly while time remains.\n\nNo separate Miss button is required.\n\nIf timer reaches 1:00 before current required mechanic is completed:\nRun automatically ends.\n\nRecord:\n- Rungs completed\n- Lap times for all completed rungs\n- Difficulty they were stuck on\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nRANKING ALGORITHM\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nPRIMARY:\nNumber of mechanics completed.\n\n3 completed beats 2.\n2 beats 1.\n1 beats 0.\n\nIf players completed all 3:\nLower Hard completion time wins.\n\nIf players completed same number below 3:\n\nCompare time they REACHED the mechanic they got stuck on.\n\nExample:\n\nBoth completed Easy but failed Medium.\n\nPlayer A completed Easy at 18.2s.\nPlayer B completed Easy at 25.4s.\n\nA reached Medium sooner.\nA ranks higher.\n\nIf those times are exactly tied:\nCompare the prior available lap time moving backward.\n\nIf players completed 0 mechanics:\nBoth were stuck on Easy.\nThere is no completed lap to compare.\nThey tie.\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n1v1\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nOne shared draft.\n\nBrowser randomizes who runs first.\n\nPlayer 1 runs.\nThen Player 2 runs.\n\nApply ranking algorithm.\n\nExact tie:\nDraw.\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n1v1v1\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nOne shared draft for all 3 players.\n\nBrowser randomizes run order.\n\nEach player receives one run.\n\nRank all 3 with ranking algorithm.\n\nExact equal states/times:\nShared placement.\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n1v1v1v1\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nSame with 4 players.\n\nOne shared draft.\nSequential runs.\nFull placement.\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n1v2 / 2v1 — TAG-TEAM MECHANIC GAUNTLET\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nThis is a series of HEAD-TO-HEAD Gauntlets.\n\nIMPORTANT:\nEach mini-match receives a COMPLETELY NEW draft.\n\nDo NOT reuse the first mini-match's mechanics.\n\n\nMINI-MATCH 1:\nSolo vs Duo Player A.\n\nFresh:\nEasy / Medium / Hard.\n\nBrowser randomizes which of those 2 runs first.\n\nDetermine mini-match winner using normal Gauntlet ranking.\n\n\nMINI-MATCH 2:\nSolo vs Duo Player B.\n\nGenerate NEW:\nEasy / Medium / Hard.\n\nDetermine winner.\n\nEach mini-match win:\n1 side point.\n\n\nIf result is:\n2–0\nChallenge ends.\n\nIf result is:\n1–1\n\nBrowser randomly chooses:\nDuo A or Duo B\n\nfor tiebreak.\n\nGenerate ANOTHER fresh Gauntlet draft.\n\nSolo vs selected Duo player.\n\nWinner:\nWins entire Challenge.\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n1v3 / 3v1 — TAG-TEAM MECHANIC GAUNTLET\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nThree head-to-head Gauntlets:\n\nSolo vs Trio A\nSolo vs Trio B\nSolo vs Trio C\n\nEVERY mini-match:\nFresh Easy / Medium / Hard draft.\n\nSolo runs once per mini-match.\nAssigned opponent runs once.\n\nEach mini-match:\n1 side win.\n\nSide winning at least:\n2 of 3\n\nwins overall Challenge.\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nGAUNTLET RECOVERY\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nDuring a run:\n\nProvide:\nRESTART CURRENT RUN\n\nUse if:\n- Timer started accidentally.\n- Player was not ready.\n- Wrong mechanic/setup issue.\n- Browser lag caused incorrect start.\n\nRestart:\nClears that player's current run timestamps only.\nDoes NOT reroll draft.\n\nAfter a run is officially submitted:\nHost can:\nREDO PLAYER RUN\n\nRequires confirmation.\n\nIf redo occurs:\nReplace old run entirely.\n\nDo not keep whichever of two runs was better.\nRedo means old run is discarded.\n\n\n=================================================="
