    "tag": false,
    "rules": "==================================================\n\nSUPPORTED FORMATS:\n- 1v1\n- 1v1v1\n- 1v1v1v1\n- 2v2\n\n\nCORE RULES\n\nEach player gets:\nOne secret random number from 1–10.\n\nOnly that player may see their number.\n\n\nAfter seeing first number:\nPlayer chooses:\n\nBANK\nor\nRISK\n\n\nBANK:\nKeep current number permanently.\n\n\nRISK:\nDiscard original number permanently.\nGenerate exactly ONE new secret 1–10 number.\nPlayer MUST keep new number even if worse.\n\nNo second Risk.\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nSECRET INFORMATION\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nUntil Reveal:\nNo player may see another player's number.\n\nIf Host is participating:\nHost must NOT receive an administrative view that exposes everyone else's values.\n\nHost may see:\n- \"ROLLED\"\n- \"DECISION LOCKED\"\n\nbut not secret number values.\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n1v1\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nEach player privately:\n\nROLL\n→ see number\n→ BANK or RISK\n\nOnce both final values are locked:\n\nHost gets:\nREVEAL\n\nReveal both values simultaneously.\n\nHigher:\nWins.\n\nEqual:\nDraw.\n\nBrowser automatically determines result.\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n1v1v1\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nAll 3 independently roll and choose.\n\nAfter everyone locks:\nHost Reveal.\n\nRank final values highest → lowest.\n\nEqual values:\nShared placement.\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n1v1v1v1\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nSame with 4 players.\n\nFull placement.\nTies shared.\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n2v2 — INDIVIDUAL WINNER WINS FOR TEAM\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nAll 4 players independently:\nRoll → Bank/Risk.\n\nDo NOT combine teammate numbers.\n\nAfter Reveal:\nFind highest INDIVIDUAL final number.\n\nThat player's team:\nWins Challenge.\n\nIf multiple highest-number players are tied:\n\nIf all tied highest players are on SAME team:\nThat team wins.\n\nIf tied highest players include BOTH teams:\nDraw.\n\nExample:\n\nTeam A:\n10, 4\n\nTeam B:\n10, 7\n\nHighest = 10 from both teams.\nDraw.\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nRECOVERY / ANTI-CHEAT\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nBefore a player presses BANK or RISK:\nThey may remain on decision screen indefinitely.\n\nAfter BANK:\nDecision is locked.\n\nAfter RISK reveals second number:\nPlayer may NOT go Back to recover first number.\n\nThat would defeat the game's risk mechanic.\n\nTechnical failure:\nHost may restart ENTIRE Push Your Luck Challenge.\n\nRestart confirmation must clearly warn:\n\"All secret rolls will be discarded and rerolled.\"\n\nDo not allow individual reroll after seeing both old and new values.\n\n\n=================================================="
