    "rules": "==================================================\n\nSUPPORTED FORMATS:\n- 1v1\n- 1v1v1\n- 1v1v1v1\n- 2v2\n\n\nCORE OBJECTIVE\n\nBe the last surviving player/team through demolitions.\n\nBall:\nIrrelevant.\n\nNormal:\n- Driving\n- Boost\n- Bumps\n- Demos\n\nare allowed unless players agree on an arena/setup separately.\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nELIMINATION\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nA player's FIRST valid demo:\nEliminates that player from the Challenge.\n\nThere are no extra lives in Demo Royale.\n\nThis is separate from Bullet Ball and Knockout.\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n1v1\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nFirst player demoed:\nLoses.\n\nOther player:\nWins.\n\nIf both are genuinely demoed simultaneously:\nDraw.\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n1v1v1\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nContinue until one player remains.\n\nElimination order determines placements.\n\nExample:\n\nC eliminated first:\n3rd.\n\nB eliminated next:\n2nd.\n\nA survives:\n1st.\n\nIf multiple players are demolished simultaneously:\nThey share that elimination placement.\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n1v1v1v1\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nSame with 4 players.\n\nContinue until one survivor.\n\nSame-time elimination:\nShared placement.\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n2v2 — LAST SURVIVOR WINS FOR TEAM\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nAll 4 players have individual life state.\n\nFirst demo:\nThat individual is out.\n\nRemaining players continue.\n\nA team wins when:\nThe opposing team has no surviving players.\n\nIf both surviving players are on same team:\nChallenge may end immediately.\nThey do not need to demo each other.\n\nIf the final surviving players from opposite teams are eliminated simultaneously:\nDraw.\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nBROWSER UI\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nDisplay all active player cards.\n\nEach player card:\nALIVE\n\nHost has:\nELIMINATE [PLAYER]\n\nWhen selected:\nConfirmation:\n\"Confirm [Player] was demolished and eliminated?\"\n\nThen:\nMark player OUT.\n\nFor FFA:\nStore elimination timestamp/order.\n\nFor 2v2:\nGroup cards by team.\n\nAutomatically detect:\n- Only one individual remains\nor\n- Only one team remains.\n\nProvide:\nUNDO LAST ELIMINATION\n\nbefore final rewards.\n\nIf Host is actively playing and cannot input immediately:\nAllow eliminations to be entered afterward in the observed order.\n\n\n=================================================="
