    "rules": "==================================================\n\nDISPLAY NAME MAY BE:\nRandom Custom Map\n\nBUT IMPLEMENTATION MEANING IS:\nA RANDOM OFFICIAL ROCKET LEAGUE PRIVATE-MATCH ARENA.\n\nDO NOT USE:\n- Workshop maps\n- Steam Workshop\n- Modded arenas\n- PC-only custom maps\n\n\nSUPPORTED FORMATS:\n- 1v1\n- 1v1v1v1 Tournament\n- 2v2\n- 1v2 / 2v1 Tag-Team\n- 1v3 / 3v1 Tag-Team\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nARENA POOL\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nMaintain one centralized approved arena list.\n\nDo not duplicate arena lists independently inside every game variant.\n\nBrowser may display:\nRANDOMIZE ARENA\n\nThis chooses one approved arena name.\n\nPlayers then manually select that arena in Rocket League.\n\nBrowser has no direct Rocket League connection.\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n1v1\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nRandomize:\n1 official arena.\n\nMatch:\n2 minutes.\n\nHighest score:\nWins.\n\nTie:\nNext goal.\n\nArena stays same through overtime.\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n1v1v1v1 — TOURNAMENT\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nUse Global Tournament System.\n\nEach mini-match may receive:\nIts own random official arena.\n\nDuring semifinal reveal:\nGenerate/reveal semifinal arenas.\n\nDo NOT reveal Final / 3rd-place arenas yet.\n\nAfter semifinals resolve:\nGenerate arenas for:\n- Final\n- 3rd-place match\n\nDuplicates are allowed.\n\nA semifinal arena may randomly appear again later.\n\nEach mini-match:\n2-minute normal 1v1.\n\nTie:\nNext goal.\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n2v2\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nRandomize:\n1 official arena.\n\nAll 4 use same arena.\n\nMatch:\n3 minutes.\n\nHighest team score:\nWins.\n\nTie:\nNext goal.\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n1v2 / 2v1 — TAG-TEAM RANDOM ARENA\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nRandomize/select:\nONE arena for ENTIRE Tag-Team Challenge.\n\nDo NOT change arena between opponents.\n\nSolo vs Duo A:\n1 minute.\n\nSolo vs Duo B:\n1 minute.\n\nCombined goals:\nDetermine side winner.\n\nTie:\nBrowser randomly chooses one Duo player.\n\nNext-goal 1v1 tiebreak on SAME arena.\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n1v3 / 3v1 — TAG-TEAM RANDOM ARENA\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nSame:\n\nOne arena for whole Challenge.\n\nSolo faces each Trio member:\n1 minute each.\n\nCombined goals.\n\nTie:\nRandom Trio member vs Solo.\nNext goal.\nSame arena.\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nREROLL / RECOVERY\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nBefore first gameplay begins:\nHost may press:\nREROLL ARENA\n\nUnlimited if:\n- Arena unavailable\n- Players accidentally selected wrong arena\n- Other setup issue\n\nOnce gameplay begins:\nArena is locked.\n\nChanging arena requires:\nRestart Current Match / Challenge confirmation.\n\n\n=================================================="
