    "tag": false,
    "rules": "==================================================\n\nSUPPORTED FORMATS:\n- 1v1\n- 1v1v1\n- 1v1v1v1\n- 2v2\n\n\nCORE OBJECTIVE\n\nRemain legally airborne longer than opponents.\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nLEGAL / ILLEGAL CONTACT\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nOnce Challenge begins and player is airborne:\n\nGROUND CONTACT:\nElimination.\n\nWALL CONTACT:\nElimination.\n\nCEILING CONTACT:\nALLOWED.\n\nPlayers may:\n- Boost\n- Maneuver\n- Bump\n- Demo\n\nBumps and demos are allowed.\n\nIf a player is demoed:\nThat player is eliminated.\n\nPlayers may use any aerial movement that does not violate ground/wall restriction.\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nSTART\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nAll active players begin simultaneously.\n\nHost starts Challenge.\n\nNo hidden timer is required.\n\nPlayers themselves determine when everyone has properly begun.\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n1v1\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nFirst player eliminated:\nLoses.\n\nRemaining player:\nWins.\n\nIf both become invalid at effectively the same moment:\nDraw.\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n1v1v1\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nContinue until:\n1 player remains.\n\nElimination order:\nDetermines placements.\n\nSame-time eliminations:\nShared placement.\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n1v1v1v1\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nSame with 4 players.\n\nContinue until one remains.\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n2v2 — LAST SURVIVING PLAYER WINS FOR TEAM\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nAll 4 are individually vulnerable.\n\nWhen player is eliminated:\nThey are out.\n\nTeam wins when:\nOpposing team has no surviving players.\n\nIf both remaining players belong to same team:\nThat team immediately wins.\n\nIf last opposing survivors become invalid simultaneously:\nDraw.\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nBROWSER UI\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nRecommended:\n\nEach player card:\nAIRBORNE / ACTIVE\n\nA player may have:\n\"I'M OUT\"\n\nbutton on their own screen.\n\nPressing it:\nMarks themselves eliminated.\n\nHost may also:\nEliminate Player\n\nfor correction/administration.\n\nWhy self-report exists:\nThis game happens simultaneously and Host may also be playing.\n\nDo not give normal players ability to eliminate other players.\n\nHost gets:\nUNDO LAST ELIMINATION\n\nBrowser records elimination order automatically.\n\n\n=================================================="
