    "tag": false,
    "rules": "==================================================\n\nTHIS IS A SEPARATE SELECTABLE CHALLENGE.\n\nSUPPORTED FORMATS:\n- 1v1\n- 1v1v1v1\n- 2v2\n\nNOT SUPPORTED:\n- 1v1v1\n\n\nFREE ROAM inherits EVERYTHING from Half-Locked Hot Potato except one rule:\n\nPLAYERS MAY DRIVE ANYWHERE.\n\nThere is NO restriction that a player must remain on their own half.\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nBALL-SIDE DETERMINATION\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nEven though players can roam freely:\n\nThe loser is still determined by:\nWHICH TEAM/PLAYER'S ASSIGNED FIELD HALF contains the ball when timer resolves.\n\nPlayer location does NOT matter.\n\nExample:\n\nPlayer A may physically be deep in Player B's half.\n\nIf ball is on Player A's half when timer explodes:\nPlayer A still loses.\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nALL OTHER RULES REMAIN IDENTICAL\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nIncluding:\n\n- Hidden random 10–60 second timer.\n- Bomb ticking audio.\n- Explosion effect.\n- Goals do not directly matter.\n- During goal explosion, ball remains attributed to side of goal it entered.\n- MUST SKIP REPLAYS.\n- Kickoff Resolution if timer expires at center.\n- Unlimited Retry for genuinely ambiguous ball position.\n- 2v2 one-explosion team result.\n- 1v1v1v1 starts as random 2v2.\n- Winning pair plays for 1st/2nd.\n- Losing pair plays for 3rd/4th.\n- Host chooses simultaneous vs sequential placement matches.\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nHOT POTATO AUDIO / SYNC REQUIREMENTS\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nFor BOTH versions:\n\nRules screen must have:\nTEST TICKING AUDIO\nTEST EXPLOSION AUDIO\n\nTesting does not start real timer.\n\nReal timer:\nUse authoritative room/server timestamp.\n\nDo not send visible remaining time.\n\nAll player browsers should receive expiration event as closely synchronized as possible.\n\nExplosion:\nShould dominate screen briefly but must not permanently block controls.\n\nAfter visual:\nShow Host resolution controls.\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nHOT POTATO ANTI-CHEAT / RECOVERY\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nDo not provide:\n\"Show Timer\"\n\nDo not expose hidden duration in normal client state/UI.\n\nIf Host retries:\nGenerate a COMPLETELY NEW random timer.\n\nDo not reuse old duration.\n\nRetry must clear:\n- Prior explosion state\n- Prior result selection\n- Prior timer\n\nDo not allow a player to individually restart only their local timer."
