    "rules": "==================================================\n\nSUPPORTED FORMATS:\n- 1v1\n- 1v1v1v1 Tournament\n- 2v2\n- 1v2 / 2v1 Tag-Team\n- 1v3 / 3v1 Tag-Team\n\n\nCORE RULE\n\nBOOSTING IS COMPLETELY PROHIBITED.\n\nEverything else follows normal Rocket League rules unless another format rule changes it.\n\nAllowed:\n- Throttle\n- Steering\n- Jumping\n- Flips\n- Wavedashes\n- Powerslide\n- Bumps\n- Demos\n- Aerial attempts without boost\n- Other normal non-boost movement\n\nPlayers enforce the no-boost restriction themselves.\n\n\n==================================================\n1v1 — NO BOOST\n==================================================\n\nMatch:\n2 minutes.\n\nHighest goals:\nWins.\n\nTie:\nNext goal under No Boost rules.\n\nBrowser:\nDefault result screen.\n\n\n==================================================\n1v1v1v1 — NO BOOST TOURNAMENT\n==================================================\n\nUse Global Tournament System.\n\nEach mini-match:\n2-minute No Boost 1v1.\n\nSemifinals:\nAlways simultaneous.\n\nFinal + 3rd:\nHost chooses simultaneous or sequential.\n\nTie:\nNext No-Boost goal.\n\n\n==================================================\n2v2 — NO BOOST\n==================================================\n\nMatch:\n3 minutes.\n\nAll 4:\nNo Boost.\n\nHighest team score:\nWins.\n\nTie:\nNext goal.\n\n\n==================================================\n1v2 / 2v1 — TAG-TEAM NO BOOST\n==================================================\n\nSolo vs Duo A:\n1 minute.\n\nSolo vs Duo B:\n1 minute.\n\nNo Boost active for every segment.\n\nBrowser records goals from each mini-match.\n\nSolo Combined Goals:\nSolo's goals from both.\n\nDuo Combined:\nA + B goals.\n\nHigher:\nWins.\n\n\nTie:\nBrowser randomly selects one Duo member.\n\nSolo vs selected Duo player:\nNo Boost next-goal tiebreak.\n\nDo not reveal tiebreak player unless tie actually occurs.\n\n\n==================================================\n1v3 / 3v1 — TAG-TEAM NO BOOST\n==================================================\n\nSolo faces:\nTrio A\nTrio B\nTrio C\n\n1 minute each.\n\nNo Boost throughout.\n\nAdd goals.\n\nHigher side:\nWins.\n\nTie:\nRandomly select one Trio member.\n\nNext No-Boost goal wins.\n\n\n=================================================="
