    "tag": false,
    "rules": "==================================================\n\nSUPPORTED FORMATS:\n- 1v1\n- 1v1v1\n- 1v1v1v1\n- 2v2\n\n\nCORE OBJECTIVE\n\nKeep naming UNIQUE valid Rocket League cars before your 10-second turn timer expires.\n\nContinue rapidly until:\nOnly one player/team remains.\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nVALID ANSWER\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nPlayer must SAY OUT LOUD:\nA valid Rocket League car.\n\nThe answer cannot have already been used during the current Challenge.\n\nExamples of obvious valid car names may include:\n- Octane\n- Fennec\n- Dominus\netc.\n\nMaintain one centralized approved Rocket League car database for dispute/reference purposes.\n\nDo NOT display the full answer database during normal active gameplay because that would effectively provide players with answers.\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nTURN TIMER\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nEach turn:\n10.0 seconds.\n\nBrowser randomly creates starting order.\n\nCurrent player has exactly one active button:\n\nANSWER SAID / PASS\n\n\nPlayer:\n\n1. Says answer aloud.\n2. Presses button.\n\nValid press before timeout:\nImmediately advances to next surviving player.\n\nNext player's fresh 10-second timer starts immediately.\n\nThere is NO normal pause between turns.\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nTIMEOUT\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nWhen timer reaches 0:\n\nCurrent player:\nEliminated automatically.\n\nImmediately move to next surviving player.\n\nNext 10-second timer begins.\n\nThe eliminated-player animation must NOT unnecessarily delay the next player's clock.\n\nA short visual \"explosion\" can happen while new turn is already active.\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nINVALID OR DUPLICATE ANSWER\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nIf player:\n\n- Repeats an already-used car.\n- Gives invalid/nonexistent car.\n\nThey are eliminated.\n\nBecause the browser cannot hear speech automatically:\nPlayers must call the error verbally.\n\nHost may press:\n\nPAUSE / DISPUTE\n\nThen:\n\nMARK CURRENT/LAST PLAYER INVALID\n\nAfter confirmation:\nEliminate offending player.\n\nResume from next surviving player.\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nDISPUTED VALIDITY\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nOptional Host tool:\n\nVALIDITY CHECK\n\nThis pauses turn timer.\n\nHost enters disputed car name.\n\nBrowser searches central approved car list.\n\nReturn:\nVALID\nor\nNOT IN APPROVED LIST\n\nThen Host resolves dispute.\n\nDo NOT show the full car database.\n\nThis tool is for disputes only.\n\n\n==================================================\n1v1 — NAME A CAR\n==================================================\n\nRandom starter.\n\nPlayers alternate.\n\nFirst:\n- Timeout\n- Duplicate\n- Invalid answer\n\nis eliminated.\n\nOther player:\nWins.\n\n\n==================================================\n1v1v1 — NAME A CAR\n==================================================\n\nRandom cyclic order.\n\nWhen someone is eliminated:\nSkip them permanently.\n\nGame continues immediately.\n\nLast survivor:\n1st.\n\nElimination order:\nDetermines lower placements.\n\nContinue until one remains.\n\n\n==================================================\n1v1v1v1 — NAME A CAR\n==================================================\n\nSame with 4 players.\n\nNo breaks between eliminations and next player's turn.\n\n\n==================================================\n2v2 — NAME A CAR\n==================================================\n\nAll 4 players remain in one alternating individual turn order.\n\nEach individual can be eliminated.\n\nTeams do NOT answer together.\n\nIf one teammate is eliminated:\nTheir teammate continues alone.\n\nChallenge ends when:\nOnly one team has at least one surviving player.\n\nIf the only 2 remaining players are teammates:\nTheir team has already won.\n\nDo not force teammates to eliminate one another.\n\nLast surviving team:\nWins.\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nNAME A CAR UI\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nDisplay:\n- Turn-order ring/list.\n- Current player highlighted.\n- Large 10.0 countdown.\n- Eliminated players greyed out.\n- Current surviving teams where applicable.\n\nCurrent player's button:\nI SAID A VALID CAR\n\nMake it large and easy to hit.\n\nHost:\nPause\nResume\nMark Invalid\nUndo Last Elimination\n\n\nUNDO:\nRestore eliminated player and correct turn order/timer state.\n\nIf timer elimination was accidental due browser issue:\nHost can restore player with a fresh 10-second turn.\n\n\n=================================================="
