    "rules": "==================================================\n\nSUPPORTED FORMAT:\n- 1v1 only\n\n\nCORE OBJECTIVE\n\nPlay a completely standard browser-based game of Tic-Tac-Toe.\n\nThere is intentionally:\nNO Rocket League gameplay involved.\n\nThis exists purely as a goofy break from the Rocket League Challenges.\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nSETUP\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nBrowser randomly determines:\n\n- Which player is X.\n- Which player is O.\n- Who moves first.\n\nDisplay clearly:\n\nBRADLEY = X\nALEX = O\n\nSTARTING PLAYER:\nBRADLEY\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nBOARD\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nStandard:\n3 × 3 grid.\n\nNine empty squares.\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nTURN SYSTEM\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nUnlike Mechanic Tic-Tac-Toe, this game CAN safely enforce turns automatically because everything happens entirely inside the browser.\n\nOnly current player's legal empty tiles should be clickable.\n\nCurrent player selects:\nOne empty tile.\n\nBrowser places:\nX or O.\n\nThen automatically switches turn.\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nWIN DETECTION\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nAfter every move:\nCheck all:\n\n3 rows\n3 columns\n2 diagonals\n\nFirst player to create:\n3 matching symbols in a row\n\nwins immediately.\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nDRAW\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nIf all 9 squares fill and no line exists:\n\nDRAW.\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nMISCLICK RECOVERY\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nBecause this is a purely browser game:\n\nHost should have:\n\nUNDO LAST MOVE\n\nUse one-step undo.\n\nUndo:\n- Removes most recent symbol.\n- Restores prior player's turn.\n- Restores game from Win/Draw state if that move ended it.\n\nDo not allow normal players to freely erase arbitrary previous moves.\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nRESULT FLOW\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nWhen win occurs:\n\nHighlight winning line.\n\nBrief pause.\n\nShow:\n[Player] WINS TIC-TAC-TOE\n\nHost still receives result-confirmation phase before Battle rewards.\n\nDraw:\nShow board + DRAW result.\n\n\n=================================================="
