    "rules": "==================================================\n\nSUPPORTED FORMATS:\n- 1v1\n- 1v1v1\n- 1v1v1v1\n- 2v2\n- 1v2 / 2v1\n- 1v3 / 3v1\n\n\nCORE OBJECTIVE\n\nBrowser randomly generates one target goal speed:\n\n1–150 KPH\n\nEvery required player receives:\nExactly 1 valid scoring attempt per normal round.\n\nObjective:\nScore a goal as close as possible to target KPH.\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nTARGET GENERATION\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nBrowser randomly generates:\nINTEGER target from 1 through 150 KPH.\n\nDisplay prominently:\n\nTARGET:\n87 KPH\n\nEveryone in the same normal round uses:\nSame target.\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nVALID ATTEMPT\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nPlayer must score a goal.\n\nIf player misses:\nThey may retry until they produce one valid scoring goal for that attempt.\n\nThe objective is precision of the successful goal's KPH, not whether they can score at all.\n\nOnce they score:\nRecord actual displayed KPH.\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nERROR CALCULATION\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nAbsolute Error =\n\n|Actual KPH − Target KPH|\n\nExamples:\n\nTarget:\n100\n\nPlayer:\n96\n\nError:\n4\n\nPlayer:\n105\n\nError:\n5\n\n96 is closer and ranks higher.\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nBROWSER INPUT\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nBrowser randomly chooses attempt order where sequential attempts are appropriate.\n\nFor active player:\n\nNumeric input:\nACTUAL KPH\n\nSubmit.\n\nBrowser calculates error automatically.\n\nShow:\n\nTARGET: 100\nACTUAL: 96\nERROR: 4\n\n\nProvide:\nCORRECT KPH\n\nbefore next major stage if Host/player mistyped.\n\n\n==================================================\n1v1 — CLOSEST TO KPH\n==================================================\n\nBrowser generates:\n1 target.\n\nEach player:\n1 scoring attempt.\n\nLowest absolute error:\nWins.\n\nTie:\nBrowser generates a NEW target.\n\nOnly tied players compete again.\n\nIn 1v1:\nBoth repeat.\n\nContinue new-target rounds until separated.\n\nNo draw.\n\n\n==================================================\n1v1v1 — CLOSEST TO KPH\n==================================================\n\nAll 3:\n1 attempt at same target.\n\nRank by lowest error.\n\nIf any players tie for placement:\nOnly tied players enter tiebreak.\n\nBrowser generates:\nNEW target for tied group.\n\nEach tied player:\n1 new attempt.\n\nRepeat until those placements separate.\n\nAlready-settled players:\nDo not repeat.\n\n\n==================================================\n1v1v1v1 — CLOSEST TO KPH\n==================================================\n\nSame with 4 players.\n\nFull placement.\n\nOnly tied players repeat using fresh targets.\n\n\n==================================================\n2v2 — TEAM ERROR SUM\n==================================================\n\nAll 4 players:\n1 attempt at same target.\n\nTeam Error:\n\nTeammate 1 Error\n+\nTeammate 2 Error\n\nLower team sum:\nWins.\n\nExample:\n\nTarget:\n100\n\nTeam A:\nA1 = 98 → error 2\nA2 = 105 → error 5\nTeam Error = 7\n\nTeam B:\nB1 = 101 → 1\nB2 = 108 → 8\nTeam Error = 9\n\nTeam A wins.\n\n\nTie:\nGenerate NEW target.\n\nAll 4 take another 1-attempt team round.\n\nCompare only new-round team error.\n\nRepeat until separated.\n\n\n==================================================\n1v2 / 2v1 — TEAM AVERAGE ERROR\n==================================================\n\nSame target for:\nSolo\nDuo A\nDuo B\n\nEach gets:\n1 attempt.\n\nSolo Score:\nSolo absolute error.\n\nDuo Score:\nAVERAGE of Duo A error and Duo B error.\n\nDuo Average =\n(A Error + B Error) / 2\n\nLower error value:\nWins.\n\nTie:\nGenerate fresh target.\n\nAll 3 take new attempt.\n\nRepeat until separated.\n\n\nIMPORTANT:\nUse full numeric precision for average.\n\nDo not prematurely round individual error values.\n\n\n==================================================\n1v3 / 3v1 — TEAM AVERAGE ERROR\n==================================================\n\nSame:\n\nSolo:\n1 error.\n\nTrio:\nAverage of all 3 teammate errors.\n\nTrio Average =\n(A + B + C) / 3\n\nLower:\nWins.\n\nTie:\nFresh target.\nEveryone takes one new attempt.\nRepeat.\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nBROWSER SAFETY\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nDo not reveal different targets to different players.\n\nTarget must be authoritative room state.\n\nRefresh:\nSame target remains.\n\nTiebreak:\nGenerate target only when tiebreak starts.\n\nDo not pre-generate/display future target.\n\n\n=================================================="
