    "rules": "==================================================\n\nSUPPORTED FORMATS:\n- 1v1\n- 1v1v1v1 Tournament\n- 2v2\n- 1v2 / 2v1 Tag-Team\n- 1v3 / 3v1 Tag-Team\n\n\nCORE RULE\n\nPlayers must physically play Rocket League while:\nSTANDING UP.\n\nThey may hold/use:\n- Controller\n- Keyboard/mouse\nnormally.\n\nThey may position themselves comfortably.\n\nThe restriction is simply:\nDo not sit down during active gameplay.\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nACCIDENTAL SIT / SETUP ISSUE\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nIf someone accidentally sits briefly or needs to adjust equipment:\n\nPlayers use common sense.\n\nDo not automatically disqualify for:\n- Moving a chair.\n- Picking something up.\n- Brief technical adjustment.\n\nIntentional sustained sitting during active play:\nNot allowed.\n\nBrowser does not monitor posture.\n\n\n==================================================\n1v1 — STANDING UP\n==================================================\n\nMatch:\n2 minutes.\n\nBoth players stand for entire active match.\n\nOtherwise:\nNormal 1v1.\n\nHighest goals:\nWins.\n\nTie:\nContinue standing.\n\nNext goal wins.\n\n\n==================================================\n1v1v1v1 — STANDING UP TOURNAMENT\n==================================================\n\nUse Global Tournament System.\n\nEach mini-match:\n2-minute Standing-Up 1v1.\n\nSemis:\nSimultaneous.\n\nFinal/3rd:\nHost chooses simultaneous or sequential.\n\nPlayers not currently playing:\nMay sit down if they want.\n\nOnly active participants must stand.\n\nTie:\nNext goal while standing.\n\n\n==================================================\n2v2 — STANDING UP\n==================================================\n\nAll 4 players:\nStand during entire active match.\n\nMatch:\n3 minutes.\n\nNormal 2v2 otherwise.\n\nHighest score:\nWins.\n\nTie:\nNext goal.\n\n\n==================================================\n1v2 / 2v1 — TAG-TEAM STANDING UP\n==================================================\n\nSolo:\nMust stand through every active segment.\n\nCurrent Duo opponent:\nMust stand during their segment.\n\nNon-active Duo member:\nDoes not need to stand while waiting.\n\nSegment 1:\n1 minute.\n\nSegment 2:\n1 minute.\n\nCombined goals:\nDetermine winner.\n\nTie:\nRandom Duo member faces Solo.\n\nNext goal while standing.\n\n\n==================================================\n1v3 / 3v1 — TAG-TEAM STANDING UP\n==================================================\n\nSame logic.\n\n3 one-minute segments.\n\nActive players stand.\n\nCombined goals.\n\nTie:\nRandom Trio member faces Solo.\nNext goal.\n\n\n=================================================="
