    "rules": "==================================================\n\nSUPPORTED FORMAT:\n- 2v2 only\n\n\nCORE OBJECTIVE\n\nThis is different from Fastest Single Team Pinch.\n\nEach duo performs:\n\n3 coordinated team-pinch attempts.\n\nEvery successful team-pinch goal contributes its KPH.\n\nThe team with the highest TOTAL KPH wins.\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nATTEMPTS\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nTeam A:\n3 total team attempts.\n\nTeam B:\n3 total team attempts.\n\nA valid team pinch must involve both teammates.\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nSCORING\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nSuccessful team-pinch goal:\nActual KPH.\n\nMiss:\n0.\n\nInvalid non-team pinch:\n0.\n\n\nTEAM TOTAL:\n\nAttempt 1\n+\nAttempt 2\n+\nAttempt 3\n\n\nExample:\n\nTEAM A:\n110 + 125 + 0\n=\n235 KPH\n\n\nTEAM B:\n95 + 101 + 100\n=\n296 KPH\n\nTeam B wins.\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nTIE\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nIf team totals are identical:\n\nEach team gets:\n1 additional TEAM pinch attempt.\n\nCompare only the new tiebreak values.\n\nHigher new KPH:\nWins.\n\nOne scores / one misses:\nScoring team wins.\n\nBoth miss:\nRepeat.\n\nExact same KPH:\nRepeat.\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nBROWSER UI\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nUse the same attempt-entry component as Team Pinch Fastest, but display:\n\nTEAM A\nAttempt 1: 110\nAttempt 2: 125\nAttempt 3: 0\nTOTAL: 235\n\nTEAM B\n...\nTOTAL: 296\n\n\nDo NOT accidentally calculate:\nMAX speed.\n\nThis variant specifically uses:\nSUM.\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nIMPLEMENTATION NOTE\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nGames 61 and 62 may share one reusable:\n\nTeamPinchChallenge\n\ncomponent.\n\nConfiguration:\n\nmode = \"FASTEST\"\nor\nmode = \"TOTAL\"\n\nFASTEST:\nUse max(valid speeds).\n\nTOTAL:\nUse sum(all speeds).\n\nEverything else can share:\n- Attempt count\n- KPH inputs\n- Tiebreak flow\n- Recovery UI\n\n\n=================================================="
