    "rules": "==================================================\n\nSUPPORTED FORMAT:\n- 2v2 only\n\n\nCORE OBJECTIVE\n\nPlay a team-based version of 2-letter HORSE using coordinated two-player shots.\n\nOne TEAM sets a coordinated play.\n\nThe opposing TEAM must copy it.\n\nFailed copies earn letters.\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nLETTERS\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nEach TEAM has:\n\n0 / 2 letters.\n\nAt:\n2 letters\n\nthat team loses.\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nSTARTING TEAM\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nBrowser randomly selects:\n\nSETTER TEAM\n\nExample:\n\nTEAM A SETS FIRST.\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nSETTER TEAM CALL\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nSetter Team verbally calls:\n\nA specific TWO-PLAYER coordinated play.\n\nExamples:\n\n- Pass → redirect\n- Backboard pass → finish\n- Team pinch\n- Center → aerial finish\n- Other clearly defined coordinated play\n\nThe call must involve both teammates.\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nSETTER ATTEMPT\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nSetter Team gets:\n\n1 TEAM attempt.\n\nIf Setter Team MISSES:\n- No letter.\n- Opposing team becomes Setter Team.\n- Begin new set.\n\nIf Setter Team successfully completes the called play:\n- Opposing team becomes Copier Team.\n- Copier Team gets exactly 1 team attempt.\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nCOPY ATTEMPT\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nCopier Team must replicate:\n\nThe same essential two-player coordinated play.\n\nPlayers/Host judge whether it was a valid copy.\n\nIf Copier succeeds:\n- No letter.\n- Previous Copier Team becomes the next Setter Team.\n\nIf Copier fails:\n- Copier Team receives 1 letter.\n- Previous Copier Team still becomes the next Setter Team.\n\n\nIMPORTANT:\n\nThe team that successfully set the shot does NOT immediately set again.\n\nAfter the copy resolution:\nRoles switch.\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n2 LETTERS\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nWhen a team reaches:\n\n2 / 2\n\nthey lose immediately.\n\nOpponent wins.\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nBROWSER UI\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nDisplay:\n\nTEAM A\nLETTERS: 0 / 2\n\nTEAM B\nLETTERS: 1 / 2\n\n\nCurrent Phase:\n\nTEAM A — SETTER\n\n\nHost controls during Set:\n\nSETTER MADE\nSETTER MISSED\n\n\nIf Setter Missed:\nSwitch Setter Team.\n\n\nIf Setter Made:\n\nDisplay:\n\nTEAM B — COPY ATTEMPT\n\nHost controls:\n\nCOPY MADE\nCOPY FAILED\n\n\nCOPY FAILED:\nBrowser adds letter automatically.\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nTURN / ROLE STATE\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nStore explicitly:\n\nsetterTeamId\ncopierTeamId\nphase:\n- SET\n- COPY\n\nDo not infer phase only from visual UI.\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nUNDO\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nHost:\nUNDO LAST COPYCAT ACTION\n\nMust restore:\n- Letter count\n- Setter team\n- Copier team\n- Current phase\n- Winner state if second letter had been assigned\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nNO AUTOMATIC SHOT JUDGING\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nBrowser never decides whether:\n- Pass was accurate\n- Shot copied correctly\n- Play actually involved both players\n\nThose are human decisions.\n\n\n=================================================="
