    "rules": "==================================================\n\nSUPPORTED FORMAT:\n- 2v2 only\n\n\nCORE OBJECTIVE\n\nA 2v2 team battle made from two back-to-back standard 1v1 segments.\n\nEach teammate plays one opposing teammate.\n\nTeam goals are added together.\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nMATCHUP GENERATION\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nBrowser randomly establishes the team pairing.\n\nExample:\n\nTEAM A:\nA1\nA2\n\nTEAM B:\nB1\nB2\n\n\nThen create:\n\nSEGMENT 1:\nA1 vs B1\n\nSEGMENT 2:\nA2 vs B2\n\n\nDo NOT reshuffle after Segment 1.\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nSEGMENT LENGTH\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nEach mini-match:\n\n2 minutes.\n\n\nNormal Rocket League 1v1 rules.\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nSEGMENT 1\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nA1 vs B1.\n\nPlay 2 minutes.\n\nAt end:\n\nHost enters:\n\nA1 GOALS\nB1 GOALS\n\n\nDo NOT use overtime at end of Segment 1.\n\nA tied first segment is allowed because the team result depends on combined goals.\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nSEGMENT 2\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nA2 vs B2.\n\nPlay 2 minutes.\n\nHost enters:\n\nA2 GOALS\nB2 GOALS\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nTEAM SCORE\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nTEAM A TOTAL:\n\nA1 Goals\n+\nA2 Goals\n\n\nTEAM B TOTAL:\n\nB1 Goals\n+\nB2 Goals\n\n\nHigher combined total:\nWins.\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nTIE\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nIf combined Team Score is tied after Segment 2:\n\nThe players from SEGMENT 2 remain in the match:\n\nA2 vs B2\n\nContinue immediately into:\nNEXT-GOAL OVERTIME.\n\nFirst goal:\nWins Pit Wall for their entire team.\n\n\nIMPORTANT:\n\nDo NOT switch back to Segment 1 players.\n\nThe second pair stays in.\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nBROWSER UI\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nDisplay:\n\nPIT WALL\n\nSEGMENT 1 / 2\n\nA1 vs B1\n2:00\n\n\nAfter first score:\n\nTEAM A RUNNING TOTAL:\nX\n\nTEAM B RUNNING TOTAL:\nY\n\n\nThen:\n\nSEGMENT 2 / 2\nA2 vs B2\n\n\nAfter final input:\nCalculate combined result automatically.\n\n\nIf tie:\n\nShow:\n\nPIT WALL TIED\n\nA2 vs B2\nNEXT GOAL WINS\n\nHost controls:\n\nA2 SCORED WINNER\nB2 SCORED WINNER\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nRECOVERY\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nHost may:\nCORRECT SEGMENT 1 SCORE\nCORRECT SEGMENT 2 SCORE\n\nbefore reward.\n\nChanging Segment 1 score:\nMust recalculate team total.\n\nDo NOT rerandomize player pairings.\n\n\n=================================================="
