    "rules": "==================================================\n\nSUPPORTED FORMAT:\n- 1v2 / 2v1 only\n\n\nROLES\n\nDUO:\nATTACKERS\n\nSOLO:\nDEFENDER\n\n\nThe browser randomly assigns:\n- Solo\n- Duo\n\nbefore the rules screen.\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nOBJECTIVE\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nThe Duo has:\n\n60 seconds\n\nto score:\n\n3 GOALS.\n\n\nThe Solo's job is simply to prevent that from happening.\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nSTARTING SETUP\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nDuo attacks.\n\nSolo defends.\n\nUse normal Rocket League gameplay unless otherwise stated.\n\nDuo members may:\n- Pass\n- Shoot\n- Rotate\n- Bump\n- Coordinate normally\n\nSolo may:\n- Save\n- Clear\n- Challenge\n- Counter-control normally\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nWIN CONDITION\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nDUO WINS if:\nThey score 3 or more goals before 60 seconds expires.\n\nSOLO WINS if:\nThey allow 2 or fewer goals before the timer expires.\n\n\nThere is no draw.\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nEARLY END\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nIf Duo scores:\nGoal #3\n\nbefore time expires:\n\nChallenge may end immediately.\n\nNo need to play remaining time.\n\n\nIf time expires with:\n0\n1\nor\n2 goals\n\nSolo wins immediately.\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nTIMER\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nBrowser provides:\n1:00 synchronized countdown.\n\nHost:\nSTART GOAL RUSH\n\nTimer visible to everyone.\n\nAt 0:\nAlert sound.\n\nIf third goal is scored just before expiration:\nPlayers decide based on whether ball fully crossed before 0.\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nBROWSER GOAL TRACKING\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nHost controls:\n\n+ DUO GOAL\n\nDisplay:\n\nGOALS:\n0 / 3\n\n\nAt:\n3 / 3\n\nfreeze timer and show:\nDUO WINS.\n\n\nAt timer expiration below 3:\nSOLO WINS.\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nGOAL EXPLOSIONS / RESETS\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nRocket League's normal reset after a goal is part of the 60-second Challenge unless players' chosen private-match setup pauses the game clock naturally.\n\nThe browser timer should represent the agreed active Challenge duration.\n\nDo not create artificial browser time extensions for goals.\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nRECOVERY\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nHost:\nUNDO LAST GOAL\n\nIf third goal was accidentally entered:\nRestore timer/result state appropriately.\n\nHost:\nRESTART TIMER\n\nrequires confirmation because it restarts whole Challenge.\n\n\n=================================================="
