    "rules": "==================================================\n\nSUPPORTED FORMAT:\n- 1v2 / 2v1 only\n\n\nDISPLAY NAME\n\nPreferred final name:\n\n2v1 HANDICAP MATCH\n\nThis replaces older wording such as:\n\"Two Keys\"\n\nand may also be referred to internally as:\nComeback Match.\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nROLES\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nSolo:\n1 player.\n\nDuo:\n2 players.\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nMATCH LENGTH\n--------------------------------------------------\n\n60 seconds.\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nBROWSER STARTING SCORE\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nSolo begins with:\n\n+2 BROWSER GOALS.\n\nThese are Challenge score points.\n\nThey do NOT need to be physically scored in Rocket League.\n\n\nInitial Battle score display:\n\nSOLO: 2\nDUO: 0\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nGAMEPLAY\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nPlay normal:\n\n1v2 Rocket League\n\nfor 60 seconds.\n\nNormal goals during the match add:\n\n+1\n\nto the corresponding side's browser Challenge score.\n\n\nExample:\n\nStart:\nSolo 2\nDuo 0\n\nDuring match:\n\nDuo scores twice.\nSolo scores once.\n\nFinal:\n\nSolo:\n3\n\nDuo:\n2\n\nSolo wins.\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nBROWSER GOAL TRACKING\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nHost buttons:\n\n+ SOLO GOAL\n+ DUO GOAL\n\n\nRunning score always visible.\n\nInitial Solo +2:\nClearly visually marked as:\n\nHANDICAP START:\n+2\n\n\nDo not make it appear as though Solo physically scored those goals.\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nTIE\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nIf browser Challenge score is tied after 60 seconds:\n\nContinue normal 1v2.\n\nNEXT ACTUAL ROCKET LEAGUE GOAL:\nWins.\n\nDo NOT apply another +2.\n\nDo NOT use multiplier scoring.\n\nOvertime begins from tied Challenge score.\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nOVERTIME UI\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nAt 0 with tie:\n\nShow:\n\nTIED\nNEXT GOAL WINS\n\n\nDisable normal timer.\n\nButtons:\n\nSOLO SCORED WINNER\nDUO SCORED WINNER\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nNO DRAW\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nSudden death resolves tie.\n\n\n=================================================="
