    "tag": false,
    "rules": "==================================================\n\nSUPPORTED FORMAT:\n- 1v2 / 2v1 only\n\n\nROLES\n\nSOLO:\n1 HUNTER\n\nDUO:\n2 RUNNERS\n\n\n==================================================\nOBJECTIVE\n==================================================\n\nThe Solo Hunter must demolish BOTH Runners before time expires.\n\nThe Duo wins if at least one Runner survives.\n\n\n==================================================\nTIME LIMIT\n==================================================\n\n2 MINUTES.\n\n\nUse one synchronized:\n\n2:00.0 countdown.\n\n\n==================================================\nGROUND-ONLY RULE\n==================================================\n\nSame ground-focused restriction as Demo Heist.\n\nDo not intentionally use:\n- Aerial escapes\n- Air dribbles\n- Ceiling routes\n\nNormal jumps/flips/wavedashes for ground movement:\nAllowed.\n\n\n==================================================\nELIMINATION\n==================================================\n\nEach Runner requires:\n\n1 demo\n\nto be eliminated.\n\n\nWhen a Runner is demolished:\n\nThey are OUT for the rest of the Challenge.\n\n\nThey must:\n\nPARK / REMAIN OUT OF PLAY.\n\nThey may not:\n- Bump Hunter\n- Block Hunter\n- Protect remaining Runner\n- Interfere with ball/car positioning\n\n\nBrowser marks:\n\nRUNNER A:\nELIMINATED\n\nand removes them from active Challenge state.\n\n\n==================================================\nWIN CONDITION\n==================================================\n\nSOLO HUNTER WINS:\n\nBoth Runners are demolished before timer reaches 0.\n\n\nDUO WINS:\n\nTimer reaches 0 while at least one Runner remains alive.\n\n\nNo draw.\n\n\n==================================================\nEARLY FINISH\n==================================================\n\nOnce second Runner is eliminated:\n\nStop timer immediately.\n\nSolo wins.\n\nNo need to play remaining time.\n\n\n==================================================\nBROWSER UI\n==================================================\n\nHUNTER:\n[Player]\n\n\nRUNNER A:\nALIVE\n\nRUNNER B:\nALIVE\n\n\nTimer:\n2:00\n\n\nHost buttons:\n\nDEMO RUNNER A\nDEMO RUNNER B\n\n\nAfter first:\n\nRUNNER A\nELIMINATED — PARK OUT OF PLAY\n\n\nAfter second:\n\nBOTH RUNNERS ELIMINATED\nSOLO WINS\n\n\n==================================================\nUNDO\n==================================================\n\nHost:\n\nUNDO LAST ELIMINATION\n\nmust restore:\n- Runner alive state\n- Winner state\n- Timer state if practical\n\nDo not require a previously eliminated Runner to stay parked after being restored.\n\n\n=================================================="
