    "tag": false,
    "rules": "==================================================\n\nSUPPORTED FORMAT:\n- 1v3 / 3v1 only\n\n\nThis is the 4-player equivalent of Two-Headed HORSE.\n\n\nROLES\n\nSOLO:\n1 PLAYER\n\nTRIO:\n3 PLAYERS\n\n\n==================================================\nROUND SETUP\n==================================================\n\nBrowser randomly selects:\n\nONE mechanic.\n\nEveryone uses same mechanic.\n\n\n==================================================\nSOLO\n==================================================\n\nSolo gets:\n\nUP TO 3 attempts.\n\nSolo side succeeds if:\nSolo makes mechanic at least once.\n\n\n==================================================\nTRIO\n==================================================\n\nEach Trio member gets:\n\n1 attempt.\n\nTrio has:\n3 total attempts.\n\nTrio side succeeds if:\n\nAT LEAST ONE Trio player makes the mechanic.\n\n\n==================================================\nROUND RESULT\n==================================================\n\nSOLO succeeds\n+\nTRIO fails\n\n→ SOLO WINS.\n\n\nSOLO fails\n+\nTRIO succeeds\n\n→ TRIO WINS.\n\n\nBOTH succeed\n\n→ Generate new mechanic.\n→ New round.\n\n\nBOTH fail\n\n→ Generate new mechanic.\n→ New round.\n\n\nContinue until exactly one side succeeds.\n\n\n==================================================\nATTEMPT EFFICIENCY\n==================================================\n\nOnce a side has already established Success:\nThat side does not need to use remaining attempts.\n\nExample:\n\nSolo makes attempt #1.\n\nSolo is now Success.\n\nNo need for Solo attempts #2–3.\n\nTrio still performs until:\n- Somebody succeeds\nor\n- All 3 fail.\n\n\n==================================================\nBROWSER\n==================================================\n\nUse same reusable system as Two-Headed HORSE.\n\nConfiguration:\n\nsoloAttempts = 3\nteamSize = 3\nteamAttemptsPerPlayer = 1\n\n\n=================================================="
