    "rules": "==================================================\n\nSUPPORTED FORMAT:\n- 1v3 / 3v1 only\n\n\nROLES\n\nTRIO:\nATTACKERS\n\nSOLO:\nDEFENDER\n\n\n==================================================\nMATCH LENGTH\n==================================================\n\n2 MINUTES.\n\n\n==================================================\nOBJECTIVE\n==================================================\n\nThe Trio attempts to score:\n\n5 GOALS\n\nwithin 2 minutes.\n\n\nSolo attempts to keep them at:\n\n4 GOALS OR FEWER.\n\n\n==================================================\nDEMOS\n==================================================\n\nDEMOS ARE NOT ALLOWED.\n\nNeither side may intentionally demo.\n\n\nBumps:\nAllowed as long as they are normal non-demo contact.\n\nDo not intentionally chase demos.\n\n\n==================================================\nGAMEPLAY\n==================================================\n\nTrio may:\n- Pass\n- Shoot\n- Rotate\n- Rebound\n- Attack normally\n\nSolo may:\n- Save\n- Clear\n- Challenge\n- Possess ball\n- Waste time legally\n- Defend normally\n\n\nSolo does NOT need to score.\n\nSolo goals, if accidentally scored, do not contribute to the Challenge objective.\n\n\n==================================================\nWIN CONDITION\n==================================================\n\nTRIO WINS:\n\nScores goal #5 before 2 minutes ends.\n\n\nSOLO WINS:\n\n2-minute time expires with Trio at:\n0–4 goals.\n\n\nNo draw.\n\n\n==================================================\nEARLY END\n==================================================\n\nOnce Trio reaches 5:\nChallenge is mathematically over.\n\nEnd immediately.\n\n\n==================================================\nBROWSER UI\n==================================================\n\nTRIO GOALS:\n\n0 / 5\n\n\nTimer:\n2:00\n\n\nHost:\n\nSTART\n\n+ TRIO GOAL\n\n\nAt 5:\nStop timer.\nTRIO WINS.\n\n\nAt 0 before 5:\nSOLO WINS.\n\n\n==================================================\nUNDO\n==================================================\n\nHost:\nUNDO LAST GOAL\n\nIf fifth goal was accidentally recorded:\nRestore game state before reward.\n\n\n=================================================="
