    "rules": "==================================================\n\nSUPPORTED FORMAT:\n- 1v3 / 3v1 only\n\n\nROLES\n\nSOLO:\nATTACKER\n\nTRIO:\nDEFENDERS\n\n\n==================================================\nMATCH LENGTH\n==================================================\n\n2 MINUTES.\n\n\n==================================================\nSOLO OBJECTIVE\n==================================================\n\nScore:\n\n1 GOAL\n\nbefore time reaches 0.\n\n\n==================================================\nTRIO OBJECTIVE\n==================================================\n\nPrevent Solo from scoring for full 2 minutes.\n\n\n==================================================\nDEFENSE-ONLY RULE\n==================================================\n\nTrio may:\n\n- Challenge\n- Save\n- Clear\n- Block\n- Rotate defensively\n- Possess temporarily to clear danger\n\n\nTrio is NOT trying to score.\n\n\nA Trio goal does not count toward a separate score.\n\n\n==================================================\nDEMOS\n==================================================\n\nDEMOS ARE NOT ALLOWED.\n\nNeither side may intentionally demo.\n\n\n==================================================\nFULL CLEAR RESET\n==================================================\n\nIf Trio clearly sends the ball:\n\nPAST MIDFIELD\n\ntoward Solo's side:\n\nSolo attacking possession is RESET.\n\n\nPlayers return ball/positions to the agreed attacking setup.\n\n\nIMPORTANT:\n\nTHE 2-MINUTE TIMER CONTINUES RUNNING.\n\nDo NOT pause timer during the reset.\n\n\nThe defenders therefore benefit from strong clears because resetting the attack consumes time.\n\n\n==================================================\nSOLO WIN\n==================================================\n\nIf Solo scores before 0:\n\nStop timer immediately.\n\nSOLO WINS.\n\n\n==================================================\nTRIO WIN\n==================================================\n\nIf timer reaches 0 without Solo goal:\n\nTRIO WINS.\n\n\nNo draw.\n\n\n==================================================\nBROWSER\n==================================================\n\nSynchronized:\n\n2:00.0 timer.\n\n\nHost:\nSTART CHALLENGE\n\nDuring active game:\n\nSOLO SCORED\n\n\nNo defender-goal button.\n\n\nAt 0:\nTRIO WINS automatically.\n\n\n=================================================="
